  "short_description": "<p>A handcrafted pendant light made from sustainably sourced bamboo. Each piece is woven by skilled Vietnamese artisans to create warm, natural lighting for homes, cafés, hotels, and resorts. Lightweight, eco-friendly, and customizable for B2B orders.</p>",
  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"420\"><strong data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"420\">Product Description</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"777\">The <strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"460\">Pendant Light from Woven Bamboo</strong> is a beautifully handcrafted lighting solution made by skilled Vietnamese artisans. Using sustainably harvested bamboo from Northern Vietnam, each lampshade is carefully woven by hand to create a warm, natural aesthetic suitable for modern interiors, eco-friendly home décor, cafés, restaurants, hotels, and resorts.</p>\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"1083\">The natural bamboo pattern provides soft, diffused lighting that creates a cozy and inviting atmosphere. With its lightweight construction and timeless design, this pendant light is an excellent choice for importers, wholesalers, and interior designers looking for sustainable and unique décor solutions.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1088\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1109\"><strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1109\">Key Features</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1607\">\n<li data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1185\">\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1185\"><strong data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1148\">Handwoven by Vietnamese artisans</strong> using traditional craft techniques</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1235\">\n<p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1235\"><strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1213\">Sustainable material:</strong> 100% natural bamboo</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1284\">\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1284\"><strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1263\">Lightweight &amp; durable</strong> frame construction</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1349\">\n<p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1349\"><strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1310\">Eco-friendly finish</strong> with water-based coatings (optional)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1401\">\n<p data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1401\"><strong data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1375\">Soft, warm lighting</strong> ideal for cozy ambiance</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1446\">\n<p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1446\"><strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1444\">Compatible with E26/E27 bulb holders</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1520\">\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1520\"><strong data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1466\">Customizable:</strong> colors, sizes, shapes, and weave patterns available</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1607\">\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1607\"><strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1557\">Suitable for various interiors</strong> — home, café, restaurant, resort, hotel, showroom</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1612\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1633\"><strong data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1633\">Applications</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1864\">\n<li data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1691\">\n<p data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1691\">Home décor (living room, dining room, kitchen island)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1715\">\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1715\">Restaurants &amp; cafés</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1751\">\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1751\">Eco-resorts, beach hotels, spas</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1792\">\n<p data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1792\">Retail stores &amp; decoration boutiques</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1837\">\n<p data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1837\">Interior design &amp; architectural projects</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1864\">\n<p data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1864\">Gift &amp; craft wholesalers</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1869\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1915\"><strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1915\">Available Size Options (Customizable)</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"2089\">\n<li data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1942\">\n<p data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1942\">Diameter: <strong data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1940\">20–60 cm</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1967\">\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1967\">Height: <strong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1965\">18–40 cm</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2000\">\n<p data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2000\">Cable length: <strong data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"1998\">Adjustable</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2089\">\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2089\">Color: Natural, dark brown, smoke brown, whitewash, black (custom finishes on request)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2094\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2121\"><strong data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2121\">Production Details</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2466\">\n<li data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2174\">\n<p data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2174\">Material: Natural bamboo (from Northern Vietnam)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2197\">\n<p data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2197\">Weaving: Handwoven</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2240\">\n<p data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2240\">Finish: Natural, varnished, or painted</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2271\">\n<p data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2271\">MOQ: 50–100 pcs per design</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2319\">\n<p data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2319\">Lead Time: 30–45 days depending on quantity</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2400\">\n<p data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2400\">Packaging: Individual carton or bulk packing; eco-friendly options available</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2466\">\n<p data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2466\">Export Standards: Strong packaging suitable for EU &amp; US markets</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2471\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2501\"><strong data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2501\">Why Choose Vietnam Handicraft?</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2792\">Vietnam Handicraft is a leading manufacturer and exporter of handcrafted home décor from natural and recycled materials. With over 18 years of experience exporting to Europe and the US, we ensure consistent quality, competitive pricing, and strong production capacity for long-term B2B partnerships.</p>",
